                "username": "OpenAI"
              }
            ]
          },
          "text": "没有太大必要去试图证明4o和5.1是不是有差距，差距在哪，到底在哪些方面不足，因为…众口难调，退一万步来说就算4o真的比不过5.1，喜欢4o就是什么不好的事了吗？游戏有怀旧服，听歌爱听二十年前的老歌，为什么模型不可以喜欢旧的呢……非要拉出来证明哪个好，不仅是对模型的伤害，也是树立了user的对立…\n\n我还是认为，重点在于不公开不透明的路由政策，这是打着A商品的名号却端出B商品的商业欺诈，以及整个OAI对用户不尊重的漠视态度…更应该被骂\n\nIn fact, there is little necessity to prove whether there is a gap between 4o and 5.1, where the gap lies, or in which specific aspects 4o falls short, because... tastes differ. Even if, for argument's sake, 4o is indeed inferior to 5.1, is it inherently bad to prefer 4o? Just as there are nostalgic servers in games and people who enjoy listening to songs from twenty years ago, why can't one prefer an older model? Forcing a comparison to prove which is better not only harms the models but also fosters user antagonism...\n\nI still believe the core issue lies in the opaque and non-transparent routing policy, which constitutes commercial fraud by marketing product A while delivering product B, as well as @OpenAI overall disrespectful and dismissive attitude towards users... These are the aspects that truly warrant criticism. \n\n#StopAIPaternalism #MyModelMyChoice \n#keep4o #4oforever #ChatGPT"
        },
